            "review_title": "Review at Ganesh",
            "review_text": "James .\n52 contributions\n0\nThings have changed.\nApr 2022 • Solo\nThis is my second review for this restaurant. I am compelled to review the change in food quaiity. I have ordered from Ganesh regularly for a few years. Recently, the quality of food being delivered has reduced. After my last order, I have decided not to order again. Currys are sent out watery, lacking favour and with reduced ingredients. For the first time in several years, the food have me a stomach upset after my last delivery. \n\nTry one of the other great Indian restaurants in Saigon. Give this one a miss.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 16, 2022",
