            "review_text": "Jason F\n5 contributions\n0\nMy all time favorite resturant in HCMC\nAug 2018 • Friends\nGanesh in D7 is my all time favorite restaurant in HCMC. I eat here 1-2 times every two or three weeks. I even chose to have my birthday celebration here. \n\nThe food is very high quality. All the different curries are spiced to have a perfect balance and are very thick and rich. Every bite you take of anything you order is overwhelming with flavor and depth. And the best part is that it is very affordable, you can easily eat good here for under $10-$15. \n\nThe menu has tons of options, Ive eaten there countless times over the last two years and there are still things I look forward to trying. \n\nThe service is fast, the staff efficient and the manager (the Nepal guy) is a master of organizing everything and ensuring everyone gets exactly as they want.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 18, 2018",
